Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1de18aff-dc5b-39a5-a2a3-2ef3ee1ce52a.xml</text>
